AuthorName: Noah Frank
AuthorWebSite: https://github.com/noah-be
SourceCode: https://github.com/noah-be/overte
IssueTracker: https://github.com/noah-be/overte/issues

AutoName: Overte Mobile (Unofficial)

RepoType: git
Repo: https://github.com/noah-be/overte.git
Binaries:
  https://github.com/noah-be/overte/releases/download/android-phone-release-v%v+%c/overte-mobile-%v-%c.apk

Builds:
  - versionName: 0.1.3
    versionCode: 4
    disable: Local review candidate; cleanup and new release build qualification pending
    commit: @COMMIT@
    timeout: 36000
    subdir: android/phone
    sudo:
      - cd /tmp
      - apt-get update
      - apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates gcc g++ cmake ninja-build
        openjdk-21-jdk-headless git make patch perl python3-pip python3-venv tar xz-utils
        util-linux iproute2
    output: apps/phoneInterface/build/outputs/apk/release/*.apk
    prebuild:
      - python3 -m venv "$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan"
      - '"$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan/bin/pip" install --no-cache-dir conan==2.25.2'
      - sdkmanager --sdk_root $$SDK$$ 'platforms;android-36' 'build-tools;35.0.0'
        'build-tools;36.0.0' 'cmake;3.31.6' 'cmdline-tools;22.0'
      - export PATH="$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan/bin:$PATH"
      - python3 fdroid/submission/build.py --acquire-only --commit $$COMMIT$$
        --version-code $$VERCODE$$ --version-name $$VERSION$$ --sdk $$SDK$$
        --work-dir "$PWD/../../../.overte-phone-fdroid-build"
    scandelete:
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/qtwebchannel-*/examples/webchannel/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/meson-*/test cases/rust/*/subprojects/*/Cargo.toml
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/meson-*/test cases/rust/*/subprojects/*/src/*/Cargo.toml
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/meson-*/test cases/rust/*/subprojects/*/subprojects/*/Cargo.toml
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/SPIRV-Tools-*/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/qtscxml-*/tests/3rdparty/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/hwloc-*/contrib/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/amaro/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/corepack/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/a*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/undici/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/node_modules/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/node_modules/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/node_modules/*/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/node_modules/*/*/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/npm/node_modules/*/*/*/*/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/node-*/deps/v8/third_party/ittapi/ittapi-rs/Cargo.toml
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/draco-*/javascript/npm/*/package.json
      - fdroid-source-closure/*/qtbase-*/src/android/java/src/org/qtproject/qt5/android/bindings/QtLoader.java
      - android/common/tests/javascript/package.json
      - scripts/communityScripts/libraries/materialdesignicons/package.json
      - scripts/developer/tests/unit_tests/package.json
      - tests-manual/entities/packet.bin
      - tests/mocha/package.json
      - tools/nitpick/AppDataHighFidelity/assignment-client/entities/models.json.gz
      - tools/nitpick/AppDataHighFidelity/domain-server/entities/models.json.gz
      - unpublishedScripts/marketplace/doppleganger-attachments/package.json
    build:
      - export PATH="$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan/bin:$PATH"
      - python3 fdroid/submission/build.py --build-only --commit $$COMMIT$$ --version-code $$VERCODE$$
        --version-name $$VERSION$$ --sdk $$SDK$$ --work-dir "$PWD/../../../.overte-phone-fdroid-build"
    ndk: 27.3.13750724

AllowedAPKSigningKeys: b62fd8f9a4ce7202a370245adb7726108f76f62dc54a3f62a0c4f24a0c4b192b

MaintainerNotes: |
  Unofficial Android Phone client maintained by Noah Frank. Source Fastlane
  metadata is discovered via subdir: android/phone; application ID is stable.
  Native dependencies use hash-pinned public source archives and no Conan binaries.
  prebuild acquires inputs and expands the complete native source closure into
  fdroid-source-closure inside the checkout for F-Droid scanning. The build phase
  only consumes prepared inputs and accepts precisely the declared scandelete
  removals; other missing, modified or added scanner sources stop the build.
  Build caches and the pinned Gradle distribution remain outside the checkout.
  Compilation requires working user/network namespaces or an already isolated
  loopback-only network. There is no online compilation fallback.
  The 36000-second limit is a ceiling, not a measured official-buildserver result.
  Standard Debian trixie tools are used; no repository code runs under sudo.
  Globbed scandelete entries remove unused vendored installation manifests and
  Qt's unused Android deployment-template loader. Phone uses its own Java bindings
  and the runtime QtAndroid.jar. There are no scanignore entries.
  source-scan-policy.json removes content-bound binary fixtures/platform tools
  in both the scanner view and Conan post_source, before compiling either context.
  Conan also removes every declared scandelete file, with exact paths and hashes,
  so the external archive cache cannot restore scanner-rejected compiler inputs.
  Full-build qualification after source cleanup is required before enabling.
  The maintainer-signed reference must match the source build and allowed key.
  Automatic updates select android-phone-release-v<versionName>+<versionCode>.
  This local draft is not the published 0.1.3 recipe. Its changed source must be
  qualified before any release or reference-APK decision; existing tags stay fixed.

AutoUpdateMode: Version
UpdateCheckMode: Tags ^android-phone-release-v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\+[1-9][0-9]*$
UpdateCheckData: '|\+([0-9]+)$||^android-phone-release-v([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)\+'
CurrentVersion: 0.1.3
CurrentVersionCode: 4
